  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{不正|ふせい}が{発覚|はっかく}する - misconduct comes to light\n・{事件|じけん}が{発覚|はっかく}する - an incident is exposed\n・{発覚|はっかく}を{恐|おそ}れる - to fear discovery\n・{発覚|はっかく}を{免|まぬが}れる - to escape detection\n\nUSAGE NOTES:\nTypically used with the intransitive pattern: Xが{発覚|はっかく}する (X comes to light)\nAlmost always refers to negative things being discovered.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n・{隠蔽|いんぺい} - concealment (what is done before {発覚|はっかく})\n・{暴露|ばくろ} - exposure (active revelation by someone)",
